            "heading": "Automatic Dishwasher Gel",
            "icon": "plant",
            "row_content": "<p>Automatic Dishwasher Gel Ingredients:</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/charcoal-filtered-deionized-water\" title=\"What is High-Purity Water (charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-treated) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>High-Purity Water</strong></a><strong>  </strong>(charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-sanitized)</p><p><strong>Tetrasodium Glutamate Diacetate</strong> (plant-based cleaner)</p><p><strong>Octyl Dimethyl Amine Oxide </strong>(plant-based cleaner)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-citric-acid-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"Everything You Need to Know About Citric Acid\"><strong>Citric Acid</strong></a> (earth mineral)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-metasilicate\" title=\"What is Sodium Metasilicate and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Sodium Metasilicate</strong></a> (earth mineral)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know\" title=\"Phenoxyethanol in Personal Care Products: What You Need to Know\"><strong>Phenoxyethanol</strong></a><strong> </strong>(safe preservative)</p><p><strong>Caprylyl Glycol</strong> (safe preservative)</p><p><a href=\"/products/lemon-orange-grapefruit-lime-essential-oil\" title=\"Lemon, Orange, Grapefruit & Lime Essential Oil Blend\"><strong>Sunburst Citrus</strong></a> Essential Oil Blend (scent)</p><p><strong>Xanthan Gum</strong> (formula stabilizer)</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_D7H7CF": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Avocado Lotion",
            "icon": "plant",
            "row_content": "<p>Lotion Ingredients:</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/charcoal-filtered-deionized-water\" title=\"What is High-Purity Water (charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-treated) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>High-Purity Water</strong></a><strong>  </strong>(charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-sanitized)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/your-ultimate-guide-to-food-grade-cold-pressed-avocado-oil\" title=\"Your Ultimate Guide to Food Grade, Cold Pressed Avocado Oil\"><strong>Persea Gratissima (Avocado) Oil</strong> </a><br/> (cold-pressed, nutrient packed oil)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-cetearyl-alcohol-and-what-does-it-do-in-hair-and-skin-products\" title=\"What is Cetearyl Alcohol and what does it do in hair and skin products?\"><strong>Cetearyl Alcohol</strong></a> (gives skin soft feel)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-cetyl-alcohol-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Cetyl Alcohol and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Cetyl Alcohol</strong></a> (soft feel)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-cetyl-alcohol-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Cetyl Alcohol and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Stearic Acid </strong></a>(veggie-based, satiny feel)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-glycerin-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Glycerin and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Vegetable Glycerin (Glycerin)</strong></a> (veggie-based, moisturizes skin. USP, kosher quality.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-glyceryl-stearate-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Glyceryl Stearate and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Glyceryl Stearate </strong></a>(veggie-based, moisturizer)</p><p><strong>Caprylyl Glycol,</strong><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know\" title=\"Phenoxyethanol in Personal Care Products: What You Need to Know\"><strong> Phenoxyethanol</strong></a> (preservatives used sparingly, prevents bacteria from growing in container) </p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-are-essential-oils\" title=\"What are Essential Oils?\"><strong>Essential Oils</strong></a><strong> and/or </strong><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-are-fragrance-oils\" title=\"What are Fragrance Oils?\"><strong>Phthalate-Free Fragrance Oils</strong></a><strong> </strong>(scent, if scented)</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_p6kT8f": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Body Wash",
            "icon": "plant",
            "row_content": "<p>Body Wash Ingredients:</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-charcoal-filtered-deionized-water-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is High-Purity Water (charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-treated) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>High-Purity Water</strong></a><strong>  (</strong>charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-sanitized)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-cocamidopropyl-hydroxysultaine-sultaine-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine (Sultaine) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Cocamidopropyl Betaine</strong></a><strong> </strong>(Naturally derived from coconut and palm-free. It is an environmentally friendly and biodegradable surfactant with mild chemistry.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-sodium-c14-16-alpha-olefin-sulfonate-aos-40-and-what-does-it-do\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Sodium C14-16 Alpha Olefin Sulfonate (AOS-40) and what does it do?\"><strong>Sodium C14-16 Olefin Sulfonate</strong></a><strong> </strong>(This mild-surfactant helps grab oil, dirt, and grease. It is also derived from coconuts, palm-free and is biodegradable.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-cocamidopropyl-hydroxysultaine-sultaine-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine (Sultaine) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine</strong></a><strong> (</strong>Naturally derived from coconut, palm-free, it is a biodegradable conditioning agent for the skin with high foaming and mild chemistry.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-coco-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Coco-Glucoside and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Coco-Glucoside</strong></a><strong> </strong>(A plant-derived, biodegradable surfactant. It is mild and safe for sensitive skin.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-glycerin-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Glycerin and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Vegetable Glycerin (glycerin)</strong></a><strong> </strong>(Derived from vegetables. It is a biodegradable, powerful moisturizer that can increase skin hydration. Food-grade & UPP kosher.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-sodium-gluconate-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Sodium Gluconate and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Sodium Gluconate</strong></a><strong> (</strong>A natural mineral that helps remove minerals from hard water.)</p><p><strong>Sodium Benzoate</strong> (gentle preservative)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-caprylyl-capryl-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside</strong></a><strong> </strong>(A biodegradable plant-based surfactant with mild chemistry and sensitive skin compatibility.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-food-grade-polysorbate-20-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Food-Grade Polysorbate 20 and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Polysorbate 20</strong></a><strong> </strong>(Plant-based formula stabilizer. USP, food-grade, kosher quality, containing no dioxane.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Phenoxyethanol in Personal Care Products: What You Need to Know\"><strong>Phenoxyethanol</strong></a><strong>, Caprylyl Glycol, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate (</strong>Food-grade preservatives. Used sparingly to prevent bacteria growth in the container.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-citric-acid-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Citric Acid and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Citric Acid</strong></a><strong> </strong>(Balances pH for ideal skincare.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-are-essential-oils\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What are Essential Oils?\"><strong>Essential Oils</strong></a> and/or <a href=\"/blogs/tips-tricks/why-we-scent-safely-and-how-to-boost-your-laundrys-smell\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Why We Scent Safely and How To Boost Your Laundry's Smell\"><strong>Phthalate-Free Fragrance Oil</strong></a> (Scent, if scented)</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_LEdGfR": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Bubble Bath",
            "icon": "plant",
            "row_content": "<p>Bubble Bath Ingredients:</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-charcoal-filtered-deionized-water-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is High-Purity Water (charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-treated) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>High-Purity Water</strong></a> (charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-treated water)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-sodium-c14-16-alpha-olefin-sulfonate-aos-40-and-what-does-it-do\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Sodium C14-16 Alpha Olefin Sulfonate (AOS-40) and what does it do?\"><strong>Sodium C14-16 Olefin Sulfonate</strong></a> (coconut-based cleanser)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-cocamidopropyl-hydroxysultaine-sultaine-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine (Sultaine) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine</strong></a> (mild coconut-based cleanser)</p><p><strong>Cocamidopropyl Betaine</strong> (coconut-based cleanser)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-coco-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Coco-Glucoside and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Coco-Glucoside</strong></a> (plant-based cleanser)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-glycerin-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Glycerin and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Vegetable Glycerin (glycerin)</strong></a> (plant-based, hydrates skin,<br/>USP kosher)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-caprylyl-capryl-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside</strong></a> (plant-based cleanser)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-food-grade-polysorbate-20-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Food-Grade Polysorbate 20 and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Polyquaternium 10 (gives skin soft feel)</strong></a></p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-food-grade-polysorbate-20-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Food-Grade Polysorbate 20 and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Polysorbate 20</strong></a> (food-grade, USP kosher with no dioxane,<br/>plant-based formula stabilizer)</p><p><strong>Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Capryl Glycol</strong> and<br/><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Phenoxyethanol in Personal Care Products: What You Need to Know\"><strong>Phenoxyethanol</strong></a> (food-grade preservatives, used sparingly to prevent bacteria<br/>from growing in container)</p><p><strong>Cucumis Sativus Fruit Extract</strong> (Cucumber Extract, hydrates<br/>skin)</p><p><strong>DL-Panthenol</strong> (Provitamin B5, plant-based, hydrates skin)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-citric-acid-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Citric Acid and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Citric Acid </strong></a>(balances pH)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-are-essential-oils\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What are Essential Oils?\"><strong>Essential Oil</strong></a> (scent, if scented)</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_qWfnhn": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Castile Soap",
            "icon": "plant",
            "row_content": "<p>Castile Soap Ingredients</p><p>Organic Trade Association. GMO-Free. 100% biodegradable.<br/>Septic & greywater-safe</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/charcoal-filtered-deionized-water\" title=\"What is High-Purity Water (charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-treated) and what does it do in products?\">Water</a></p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-coconut-oil-and-what-does-it-do-in-hair-products\" title=\"What is Coconut Oil and what does it do in hair products?\">Organic Coconut Oil</a></p><p>Organic Extra Virgin Olive Oil</p><p>Organic Castor Oil</p><p>Organic Sunflower Oil</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/unlock-the-soothing-power-of-aloe-vera-leaf-juice-for-hair-and-skin-your-ultimate-guide\" title=\"Unlock the Soothing Power of Aloe Vera Leaf Juice for Hair and Skin: Your Ultimate Guide\">Organic Aloe</a></p><p>Potassium Hydroxide</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-citric-acid-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-citric-acid-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\">Citric Acid</a></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_m9bwaw": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Coconut Conditioner",
            "icon": "plant",
            "row_content": "<p>Conditioner Ingredients</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/charcoal-filtered-deionized-water\" title=\"What is High-Purity Water (charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-treated) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>High-Purity Water</strong></a><strong>  </strong>(charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-sanitized)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-cetyl-alcohol-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-cetyl-alcohol-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\"><strong>Cetyl Alcohol</strong></a><strong> </strong>(softens, smooths hair)</p><p>Behentrimonium Methosulfate (plant-based detangler)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-coconut-oil-and-what-does-it-do-in-hair-products\" title=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-coconut-oil-and-what-does-it-do-in-hair-products\"><strong>Cocos Nucifera (Coconut) Oil</strong></a><strong> </strong><br/>(moisturizes and seals)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-shea-butter-and-what-does-it-do-in-hair-products\" title=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-shea-butter-and-what-does-it-do-in-hair-products\"><strong>Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea Butter)</strong> <strong>Fruit</strong></a><strong> </strong>(moisturizes)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-glyceryl-stearate-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-glyceryl-stearate-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\"><strong>Glyceryl Stearate</strong></a> (veggie-based, protective barrier. PEG-free) </p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-polysorbate-20-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Food-Grade Polysorbate 20 and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Polysorbate 20</strong></a> (plant-based formula stabilizer. USP, food-grade, kosher quality, containing no dioxane)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-gluconate\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Sodium Gluconate and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Sodium Gluconate</strong></a><strong> </strong>(helps hydrate scalp and follicles)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know\" title=\"Phenoxyethanol in Personal Care Products: What You Need to Know\"><strong>Phenoxyethanol</strong></a><strong>, Caprylyl Glycol </strong>(preservatives used sparingly, prevents bacteria from growing in container)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-are-essential-oils\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What are Essential Oils?\"><strong>Essential Oils</strong></a><strong> and/or </strong><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-are-fragrance-oils\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What are Fragrance Oils?\"><strong>Phthalate-Free Fragrance Oils</strong></a> (scent, if scented)</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_GEdyUp": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Dish Soap",
            "icon": "plant",
            "row_content": "<p>Dish Soap Ingredients:</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/charcoal-filtered-deionized-water\" title=\"What is High-Purity Water (charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-treated) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>High-Purity Water</strong></a><strong>  </strong>(charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-sanitized)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-c14-16-alpha-olefin-sulfonate-aos-40-and-what-does-it-do\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Sodium C14-16 Alpha Olefin Sulfonate (AOS-40) and what does it do?\"><strong>Sodium C14-C16 Olefin Sulfonate</strong></a> (This mild-surfactant helps grab oil, dirt,<br/>and grease. It is also derived from coconuts, palm-free and is  biodegradable.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-cocamidopropyl-hydroxysultaine-sultaine-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine (Sultaine) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine</strong></a> (Naturally derived from coconut, palm-free, it is a biodegradable conditioning agent for the skin with high foaming and mild<br/>chemistry.)</p><p><strong>Cocamidopropyl Betaine</strong> (Naturally derived from coconut and palm-free. It is an environmentally friendly, high-foaming, and biodegradable surfactant with mild chemistry.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-coco-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Coco-Glucoside and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Coco-Glucoside</strong></a> (A plant-derived, biodegradable surfactant. It is mild and safe for sensitive skin.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-glycerin-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Glycerin and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Vegetable Glycerin</strong></a> (Derived from vegetables. It is a biodegradable,<br/>powerful moisturizer that can increase skin hydration. Food-grade &<br/>USP kosher.)</p><p><strong>Tetrasodium Glutamate Diacetate</strong> (A natural mineral that helps remove minerals from hard water.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-gluconate\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Sodium Gluconate and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Sodium Gluconate</strong></a> (A natural mineral that helps remove minerals from<br/>hard water.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-caprylyl-capryl-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside</strong></a> (A biodegradable plant-based surfactant with mild chemistry and sensitive skin compatibility.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-polysorbate-20-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Food-Grade Polysorbate 20 and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Polysorbate 20</strong></a> (Plant-based surfactant that helps stabilize the<br/>formula when adding essential oils or phthalate-free fragrances. <em>Biodegradable.<br/>USP kosher. Food-Grade. 100% Dioxane-free.)</em></p><p><strong>Caprylyl Glycol</strong> & <a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know\" title=\"Phenoxyethanol in Personal Care Products: What You Need to Know\"><strong>Phenoxyethanol</strong></a> (Safe preservatives that are used sparingly in order to prevent bacteria from growing in container.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-citric-acid-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Citric Acid and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Citric Acid</strong></a> (Balances pH)</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
