            "row_content": "<p>Pet Conditioner Ingredients:</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/charcoal-filtered-deionized-water\" title=\"What is High-Purity Water (charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-treated) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>High-Purity Water</strong></a><strong>  </strong>(charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-sanitized)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-ethyl-alcohol\" title=\"What is Ethyl Alcohol and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Alcohol (Ethyl)</strong></a><strong> </strong>(Speeds drying.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-caprylyl-capryl-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Capryl Caprylyl Glucoside</strong></a><strong> </strong>(A biodegradable plant-based surfactant with mild chemistry and sensitive skin compatibility.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-coco-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Coco-Glucoside and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Coco- Glucoside</strong></a><strong> </strong>(A plant-derived, biodegradable surfactant. It is mild and safe for sensitive skin.)</p><p><strong>Sodium Citrate </strong>(Mineral based. Helps grab and remove minerals.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-gluconate\" title=\"What is Sodium Gluconate and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Sodium Gluconate</strong></a><strong> </strong>(Mineral based. Helps grab and remove metals.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know\" title=\"Phenoxyethanol in Personal Care Products: What You Need to Know\"><strong>Phenoxyethanol</strong></a><strong> & Caprylyl Glycol</strong> (gentle preservatives, used sparingly to prevent bacteria growth)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-citric-acid-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Citric Acid and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Citric Acid</strong></a><strong> </strong>(neutralizes pH)</p><p>Scent: Pet Safe Phthalate Free Fragrance Oil</p>",
