          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_NHLbHz": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Pet Shampoo",
            "icon": "paw_print",
            "row_content": "<p>Pet Shampoo Ingredients</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/charcoal-filtered-deionized-water\" title=\"What is High-Purity Water (charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-treated) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>High-Purity Water</strong></a><strong>  </strong>(charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-sanitized)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-cocamidopropyl-hydroxysultaine-sultaine-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine (Sultaine) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine</strong></a><strong> </strong>(Naturally derived from coconut, palm-free, it is a biodegradable conditioning agent for hair and skin with high foaming and mild chemistry)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-c14-16-alpha-olefin-sulfonate-aos-40-and-what-does-it-do\" title=\"What is Sodium C14-16 Alpha Olefin Sulfonate (AOS-40) and what does it do?\"><strong>Sodium C14-16 Olefin Sulfonate</strong></a><strong> </strong>(This mild-surfactant helps grab oil, dirt, and grease. It is also derived from coconuts, palm-free and is biodegradable)</p><p><strong>Cocamidopropyl Betaine (</strong>Naturally derived from coconut and palm-free. It is an environmentally friendly, high-foaming, and biodegradable surfactant with mild chemistry)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-glycerin-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Glycerin and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Vegetable Glycerin (glycerin)</strong></a><strong> </strong>(Derived from vegetables. It is biodegradable and helps the plant surfactants do their job. Food-grade & USP kosher)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-coco-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Coco-Glucoside and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Coco- Glucoside</strong></a><strong>  </strong>(A plant-derived, biodegradable surfactant. It is mild and<br/>safe for sensitive skin)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-caprylyl-capryl-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside</strong></a><strong> </strong>(A plant-based surfactant that increases lather potential with mild chemistry for sensitive skin)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-polysorbate-20-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Food-Grade Polysorbate 20 and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Polysorbate 20</strong></a><strong> </strong>(Plant-based surfactant that helps stabilize the formula when<br/>adding essential oils or phthalate-free fragrances. <em>Biodegradable. Kosher.<br/>Food-Grade. 100% Dioxane-free)</em></p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-chloride\" title=\"What is Sodium Chloride and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Sodium Chloride</strong></a><strong> (</strong>Salt)</p><p><strong>Sodium Benzoate & Potassium Sorbate (</strong>Food-grade preservatives that are used sparingly to prevent bacteria from growing in the container)</p><p><strong>Caprylyl Glycol & </strong><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know\" title=\"Phenoxyethanol in Personal Care Products: What You Need to Know\"><strong>Phenoxyethanol</strong></a><strong> (</strong>Safe preservatives which are used sparingly to prevent bacteria from growing in container)</p><p>Scent: Pet Safe Phthalate Free Fragrance Oil</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
