            "heading": "Shampoo",
            "icon": "plant",
            "row_content": "<p>Shampoo Ingredients:</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/charcoal-filtered-deionized-water\" title=\"What is High-Purity Water (charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-treated) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>High-Purity Water</strong></a><strong>  </strong>(charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-sanitized)</p><p><strong>Cocamidopropyl Bentaine (</strong>Naturally derived from coconut and palm-free. It is an environmentally friendly and biodegradable surfactant with mild chemistry.)<br/><br/><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-cocamidopropyl-hydroxysultaine-sultaine-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine (Sultaine) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine</strong></a><strong> </strong>(Naturally derived from coconut, palm-free, it is a biodegradable conditioning agent for hair and skin with high foaming and mild chemistry.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-c14-16-alpha-olefin-sulfonate-aos-40-and-what-does-it-do\" title=\"What is Sodium C14-16 Alpha Olefin Sulfonate (AOS-40) and what does it do?\"><strong>Sodium C14-16 Olefin Sulfonate</strong></a><strong> </strong>(This mild-surfactant helps grab oil, dirt, and grease. It is also derived from coconuts, palm-free and is biodegradable.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-glycerin-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Glycerin and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Vegetable Glycerin (glycerin)</strong></a><strong> (</strong>Derived from vegetables. It is a biodegradable, powerful moisturizer that can increase skin hydration. Food-grade & Kosher.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-coco-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Coco-Glucoside and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Coco-Glucoside</strong></a><strong> </strong>(A plant-derived, biodegradable surfactant. It is mild and safe for sensitive skin.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-caprylyl-capryl-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside</strong></a><strong> </strong>(A plant-based surfactant that increases lather potential with mild chemistry for sensitive skin.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-polyquaternium-7-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Polyquaternium 7 and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Polyquaternium 10</strong></a><strong> </strong>(Gives skin soft feel. Formaldehyde-free.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-polysorbate-20-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Food-Grade Polysorbate 20 and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Polysorbate 20</strong></a><strong> (</strong>Plant-based formula stabilizer. USP, food-grade, kosher quality, containing no dioxane.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-gluconate\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Sodium Gluconate and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Sodium Gluconate </strong></a><strong>(</strong>A natural mineral that helps remove minerals from hard water.)<br/><br/><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know\" title=\"Phenoxyethanol in Personal Care Products: What You Need to Know\"><strong>Phenoxyethanol</strong></a><strong>, Caprylyl Glycol, </strong><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-benzoate\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Sodium Benzoate and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Sodium Benzoate</strong></a><strong>, </strong><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-potassium-sorbate\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Potassium Sorbate and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Potassium Sorbate</strong></a><strong>  </strong>(Food-grade preservatives. Used sparingly to prevent bacteria from growing in container.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-are-essential-oils\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What are Essential Oils?\"><strong>Essential Oils</strong></a><strong>  </strong>and/or <a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-are-fragrance-oils\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What are Fragrance Oils?\"><strong>Phthalate-Free Fragrance Oils</strong></a> (Scent, if scented)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-citric-acid-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Citric Acid and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Citric Acid</strong></a><strong> </strong>(Balances pH)</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
