            "row_content": "<p>Oxy Boost Ingredients:</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-sodium-percarbonate-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Sodium Percarbonate and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Sodium Percarbonate</strong></a> (non-chlorine bleach, whitener)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-sodium-bicarbonate-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Sodium Bicarbonate and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Sodium Bicarbonate</strong></a> (odor remover)</p>",
            "page": ""
