          "settings": {
            "heading": "Powder Laundry Detergent",
            "icon": "plant",
            "row_content": "<p>Powder Laundry Detergent Ingredients:</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-carbonate\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Sodium Carbonate and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Sodium Carbonate</strong></a><strong> </strong>(washing soda, cleaner)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-percarbonate\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Sodium Percarbonate and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Sodium Percarbonate</strong></a><strong> </strong>(non-chlorine oxygen bleach, whitener)</p><p><strong>Sodium Bicarbonate</strong> (odor remover)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-gluconate\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Sodium Gluconate and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Sodium Gluconate</strong></a><strong> </strong>(salt, binds metals together)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-chloride\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Sodium Chloride and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Sodium Chloride</strong></a><strong> </strong>(salt, water softener)</p><p></p>",
